      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This also happens on live.\nThe loading screen keeps you in the same scene as before. It only despawns every gameobject from the scene, fades to black and loads it's own objects and skybox. And only switches scenes once it's ready to load you into the world you're going into (that's when you see the Initializing World thing)\nThis means that worlds that do funky tricks with lighting and skybox shaders might cause bugs like this to happen. You might also see screwed up colors on images and more.\nSince this isn't beta-specific I think this should be moved to Bug Reports, but I wouldn't be surprised if there's already one for this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
